@startuml
title Service Complaint Handling
hide footbox
autonumber
skinparam sequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #A9DDE7
skinparam sequenceLifeLineBackgroundColor #A9DDE7
actor Reporter as R
actor "Service Provider" as P
actor "Staff / Admin" as A
participant "ServiceComplaints\n<<UI>>" as U
participant "ServiceComplaintController" as C
participant "ServiceComplaintService" as S
database "Complaint / Event\nService / ModerationLog" as E
== 1. Submit a complaint ==
R -> U: submitReport(content, images)
U -> C: submit(serviceId, content, images)
C -> S: submit(serviceId, content, images)
S -> E: save validated complaint\nstatus = PENDING
E --> S: saved complaint
S --> C: return Detail
C --> U: 201 Created + Detail
U --> R: display receipt and tracking link
== 2. Review the complaint ==
A -> U: openComplaint(id)
U -> C: detail(id)
C -> S: detail(id): check access
S -> E: load complaint, evidence and history
E --> S: return complaint data
S --> C: return Detail + permissions
C --> U: return result
U --> A: display complaint
opt Additional information is needed; no response request is outstanding
A -> U: requestProviderResponse(reason)
U -> C: review(id, revision,\nREQUEST_EXPLANATION, reason)
C -> S: review(...)
S -> E: keep PENDING; responseRequested = true\nappend event and audit; increment revision
S --> C: return updated Detail
C --> U: return result
U --> A: display request confirmation
opt The provider responds before the report is resolved
P -> U: open staff request and read instructions
U -> C: detail(id)
C -> S: detail(id): check ownership
S --> C: return Detail + canExplain
C --> U: return staff request
U --> P: display staff request and response form
P -> U: sendResponseToStaff(content, images)
U -> C: explain(id, revision, content, images)
C -> S: explain(...): verify pending request
S -> E: keep PENDING; responseRequested = false\nsave response event, images and audit
S --> C: return updated Detail
C --> U: return result
U --> P: display response confirmation
end
end
== 3. Resolve the complaint ==
A -> U: review available evidence; choose decision
U -> C: review(id, revision, action, reason)
C -> S: review(...): check staff access,\nconflict of interest and revision
alt DISMISS — no removal
S -> E: save RESOLVED + outcome DISMISS\npreserve current publication state
else REMOVE — staff confirms removal
S -> E: save RESOLVED + outcome REMOVE\nset moderationHidden = true
end
S -> E: clear response request; increment revision\nappend decision event and moderation audit
S --> C: return updated Detail
C --> U: return result
U --> A: display outcome and reason
@enduml